  data: {
    LLM: '1. On your turn, draw 1-2 cards from stock, then meld; OR draw 3 cards without melding\n2. Must begin by drawing at least one card\n3. If draw second card, must either meld or draw third card\n4. If draw third card, cannot meld this turn\n5. Melds are sequences (3+ consecutive cards) or groups (3+ same rank, different suits)\n6. Ace can be high or low but not interior (Q-K-A and A-2-3 valid, K-A-2 not valid)\n7. Jokers are wild and must be declared when played\n8. Can rearrange existing table melds when adding new cards\n9. All table cards must end in valid melds after your turn',
    Player: '1. On your turn, draw 1-2 cards from stock, then meld; OR draw 3 cards without melding\n2. Must begin by drawing at least one card\n3. If draw second card, must either meld or draw third card\n4. If draw third card, cannot meld this turn\n5. Melds are sequences (3+ consecutive cards) or groups (3+ same rank, different suits)\n6. Ace can be high or low but not interior (Q-K-A and A-2-3 valid, K-A-2 not valid)\n7. Jokers are wild and must be declared when played\n8. Can rearrange existing table melds when adding new cards\n9. All table cards must end in valid melds after your turn',
    objective: 'Be the first player to get rid of all your cards by melding them in valid combinations. Score the lowest penalty points over multiple hands.',
    gameplay: '1. On your turn, draw 1-2 cards from stock, then meld; OR draw 3 cards without melding\n2. Must begin by drawing at least one card\n3. If draw second card, must either meld or draw third card\n4. If draw third card, cannot meld this turn\n5. Melds are sequences (3+ consecutive cards) or groups (3+ same rank, different suits)\n6. Ace can be high or low but not interior (Q-K-A and A-2-3 valid, K-A-2 not valid)\n7. Jokers are wild and must be declared when played\n8. Can rearrange existing table melds when adding new cards\n9. All table cards must end in valid melds after your turn',
